        <details class="reveal"><summary>Which email accounts work with PupMail?<span>+</span></summary><p>Gmail and Yahoo have guided presets. You can also connect providers that offer encrypted IMAP and SMTP access using a password or app password.</p></details>
        <details class="reveal"><summary>Does PupMail work offline?<span>+</span></summary><p>Downloaded messages remain available for reading, and drafts save locally. Sending and mailbox changes require a connection.</p></details>
        <details class="reveal"><summary>Where are my passwords stored?<span>+</span></summary><p>Saved credentials use the system keyring: Secret Service on Linux and Credential Manager on Windows. Session-only credentials are also supported.</p></details>
